    "detailed_description": "Go Fast! Be Rad!<br><br>Our game Turbo Lizard is a very silly 3d platforming game with inspirations from Sonic, <br>Goat Simulator and Skateboarding games.<br><br>Turbo Lizard is a love letter to the city of Malm\u00f6 in Sweden and takes place in Folkets Park*<br>Where you play as an escaped lizard on a quest to free all of their friends from the pet shop.<br><br>Explore the park, meet other animals, tackle people, tackle challenges, <br>tackle everything really.<br><br>The more things you tackle the faster you\u2019ll go<br>The faster you go the more points you get<br>Spend these points to unlock abilities and further the story.<br><br><i>*Placeholder images are from our prototype and not the final setting of the game</i>",
